OL,3,GNEWSALong delays as part of A14 blocked
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A14 has been blocked
OL,7,Ffollowing a crash.
OL,9,FTwo lanes of the westbound carriageway
OL,10,Fare shut between junction 37 and
OL,11,Fjunction 36 near Newmarket, Suffolk.
OL,13,FThe incident was first reported at
OL,14,F05:55 BST, according to the traffic
OL,15,Fsystem Inrix.
OL,17,FLong queues are building in the area,
OL,18,Fit added.
